# Contact form (optional). Get a free key at https://web3forms.com by entering
# your email — it is mailed to you instantly. Without it, the form falls back to
# a mailto: link.
#
# This value is baked into the built JavaScript, so it is public. That is how
# Web3Forms works; it can only deliver mail to the address it was issued for.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
